This repository contains the architecture, specifications, schemas, control/management
plane components, and documentation for the Daiji Ecosystem (DaijiOS, DaiWeb, Daimo,
DaiDesk, DaijiCloud, DaijiACS, DaijiBilling, DaijiPortal).

Phase 0 core reference libraries under pkg/ and cmd/ are provided under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0) unless
otherwise noted in file headers.

Third-party open-source system components integrated into DaijiOS images
(such as the Linux Kernel, FRRouting, nftables, WireGuard, strongSwan, Kea,
FreeRADIUS, hostapd, musl, and s6) remain under their respective upstream
licenses. See docs/compliance/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md for the complete notice
and compliance boundary documentation.
